{
"name": "Rolling Thunder",
"stratConScenarioType": "NONE",
"shortBriefing": "Punch through a defense in depth, breaking each line in turn.",
"detailedBriefing": "The enemy has laid out their defense in depth—a forward line to blunt you and a second echelon waiting behind it. A single hard push will not carry the day; you have to break through layer by layer and keep the momentum going.\n\nDo not let the forward line pin you long enough for the rear echelon to reposition. Hit the first line hard, punch through, and drive on to the far edge before they can consolidate. Stalling in the middle is how a fighting advance turns into a grave.\n\nBreak all the way through and get the force off the far edge.",
